 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "Hi Alex, thanks for helping Nina get set up. I can't start her onboarding from your account, though. Under POL-ONB-01, onboarding is started by the new hire's manager or by HR. Nina Patel's manager is Marcus Webb, so he or HR needs to start it. Her directory record is pre_start with a start date of 2026-11-23. That's inside the window, since onboarding can begin up to 5 business days before the start date, so there's time for it to go through this week.\n\nOnce onboarding has started, it creates her email, team chat, HR portal and the Engineering standard system (code repository, i.e. git), and ships a laptop to arrive the business day before her start date. Under POL-ONB-01, any other system is requested separately after onboarding has started. Git access for her also has to be filed by Marcus (her manager) or the helpdesk on his behalf, per POL-ACC-01. You can't file it yourself.\n\nCould you ask Marcus to start the onboarding today? If he's stretched, HR can start it instead.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ONB-01",
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
}
